This directory began as a vendored copy of tep 0.8.1
(https://github.com/OriPekelman/tep), taken on 2026-05-28. It has been
rewritten in place since: the socket layer rides spinel's sp_net, the
server is a green thread per connection, and the fiber scheduler and C
shim are gone. The HTTP request parser, the response object, and the
WebSocket codec (websocket/) remain substantially tep's text.

